{
  "brief": "o3dj-envelope-brief/spike-0",
  "id": "d12-swing-arm",
  "script": "scripts/envelope-spike/corpus/d12-swing-arm.o3j.js",
  "role": "defect",
  "sources": [
    "Seeded envelope defect D12 (a narrow angle band): an arm turned about Z next to a fixed post. Two parts. The arm hits the post only within a few degrees of the post's angle, and only when it is long enough to reach it. Original test part for the Open3DJ envelope spike, MIT. Units are mm, Z is up."
  ],
  "params": [
    {
      "name": "Angle",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 20,
      "min": 0,
      "max": 90,
      "unit": "deg"
    },
    {
      "name": "Arm length",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 30,
      "min": 20,
      "max": 40,
      "unit": "mm"
    }
  ],
  "gates": [],
  "assertions": [
    {
      "id": "builds",
      "kind": "builds"
    },
    {
      "id": "status",
      "kind": "status",
      "in": [
        "ok"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "valid",
      "kind": "valid"
    },
    {
      "id": "occurrences",
      "kind": "count",
      "quantity": "occurrences",
      "expect": {
        "eq": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "no-clash",
      "kind": "fits",
      "fit": "clash",
      "expect": {
        "eq": 0
      }
    }
  ],
  "defect": {
    "fails": [
      "no-clash"
    ],
    "region": "scripts/envelope-spike/corpus/regions.ts REGIONS[\"d12-swing-arm\"]"
  }
}
